Package: tsunyx-launcher
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.3), qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-workspace, kwin-wayland (>= 4:6.3), qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-plasma5support, qml6-module-org-kde-taskmanager | plasma-workspace (<< 4:6.4)
Recommends: konsole, uzunyx-timer
Description: GNOME-style fullscreen app grid launcher and panel search box for Plasma
 Plasma 6 panel widget (local.tsunyxlauncher) with a big paginated icon
 grid, live categorized search, keyboard navigation and a Spanish
 translation. It covers the screen except the panel and opens with the
 Super key like any other Plasma launcher.
 .
 Includes the "Tsunyx Launcher: Skip Taskbar" KWin script, enabled by
 default, which keeps the launcher window out of the taskbar, pager and
 window switcher.
 .
 Also ships Tsunyx Search (local.tsunyxsearch), a search box that sits in
 the panel: it finds apps, files and more like Tsunyx Launcher and, when
 KRunner recognizes the text as a terminal command, runs it in Konsole,
 which stays open afterwards.
